Who is Ding Chengxin?

258
00:07:11,670 --> 00:07:12,650
Who is Ding Chengxin?

259
00:07:12,650 --> 00:07:13,350
Yeah, who is Ding Chengxin?

260
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,300
You know him.

261
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:16,180
(Adorably pretending to be clueless)

262
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,320
You guys have a gesture, right?

263
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:18,980
TNT Ding Chengxin, right?

264
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:20,100
Do you know him?

265
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:20,920
Let him finish.

266
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,320
I want to see if your joke is funny.

267
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,560
No, I'm already done.

268
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,220
